#: modules/tilemap/editor/tile_set_atlas_source_editor.cpp:2481
msgid "The vertical offset to use for tile sorting based on its Y coordinate (in pixels). This allows using layers as if they were on different height for top-down games. Adjusting this can help alleviate issues with sorting certain tiles. Only effective if Y Sort Enabled is true on the TileMap layer the tile is placed on."
msgstr ""

#: modules/tilemap/editor/tile_set_atlas_source_editor.cpp:2482
